  "description": "Find the maximum number of consecutive 1s in an array if you can flip at most one 0.",
  "target": 1,
  "pseudocode": "1. let left = 0, right = 0, zeros = 0, maxLen = 0\n2. while right < nums.length:\n3.   if nums[right] == 0: zeros++\n4.   while zeros > 1:\n5.     if nums[left] == 0: zeros--\n6.     left++\n7.   maxLen = Math.max(maxLen, right - left + 1)\n8.   right++",
